cols\">\n                      <div class=\"grid-col grid-col-416-1-1\">\n              <div class=\"grid-items\">\n                                  <div class=\"grid-item grid-item-416-1-1-1\">\n                    <div class=\"module module-blocks module-blocks-417 blocks-tabs\">\n    <div class=\"module-body\">\n                <div class=\"tabs-container\">\n      <ul class=\"nav nav-tabs\">\n                  <li class=\"tab-2 active\">\n                          <a href=\"#blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-1\" data-toggle=\"tab\">Description</a>\n                      </li>\n                  <li class=\"tab-4\">\n                          <a href=\"#blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-2\" data-toggle=\"tab\">Product Table</a>\n                      </li>\n                  <li class=\"tab-5\">\n                          <a href=\"#blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-3\" data-toggle=\"tab\">Video</a>\n                      </li>\n                  <li class=\"tab-6\">\n                          <a href=\"#blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-4\" data-toggle=\"tab\">Review</a>\n                      </li>\n              </ul>\n      <div class=\"tab-content\">\n                              <div class=\"module-item module-item-2 tab-pane active\" id=\"blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-1\">\n                  <div class=\"block-body expand-block\">\n            <div class=\"block-wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"block-content  block-description\">\n                <p></p><h2>AC Power Cord | C14 to C19 | 18 AWG | 6 ft | Black</h2>This premium 6Ft AC Power Cord features C14 to C19 connectors with a durable 18 AWG gauge, delivering safe and efficient power for demanding equipment. Designed for Cisco PWR-2700-AC, it is also compatible with a wide range of C14 inlet devices including Cisco UCS series servers, Catalyst switches, Nexus switches; HP ProLiant DL/ML servers; Dell PowerEdge R/T series; APC Smart-UPS models; IBM System x servers; and PDUs from APC, Tripp Lite, and Eaton. Perfect for data centers, enterprise networks, and professional IT environments, this cable ensures reliable performance and long service life.<p></p><h3>Supply End:</h3><p>C14, or IEC60320-C14, is a 3 prong, male connector commonly used as a PDU supply end and computer power supply. These ends plug into a C14, or IEC60320-C13.<br></p><h3>Equipment End:</h3><p>C19, or IEC60320-C19 is a 3 prong, female connector commonly used on the end of high current computer and networking device power cords.These ends plug into a C20, or IEC60320-C20.</p><h3>Features:</h3><p>Equipment end IEC60320-C19 is a 3 prong, female connector</p><p>Supply end IEC60320-C14, is a 3 prong, male connector</p><p>The power cord has a thickness of 18AWG&nbsp;</p><p>The cord is 6ft in length</p>\n              </div>\n          </div>\n  </div>\n\n            </div>\n                                        <div class=\"module-item module-item-4 tab-pane\" id=\"blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-2\">\n                  <div class=\"block-body expand-block\">\n            <div class=\"block-wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"block-content  block-dynamic\">\n                <div class=\"module-compatibility-table\" id=\"tab-compatibility\">\n            <h3>Product List</h3>\n        <div class=\"module-compatibility-table-content\">\n      \n        <div class=\"table-responsive\">\n          <table class=\"table table-bordered\">\n            <thead>\n                <tr>\n                  <td class=\"compatibility-table-name\"><strong></strong></td>\n                  <td class=\"compatibility-table-price\"><strong>Price</strong></td>\n                </tr>\n            </thead>\n            <tbody>\n                                <tr>    \n                    <td class=\"compatibility-table-name\"><a href=\"/cisco-cab-c15-cbn-250-vac-13a-cabinet-jumper-power-cord\">Cisco CAB-C15-CBN 250 VAC 13A Cabinet Jumper Power Cord</a></td>\n                    <td class=\"compatibility-table-price\">\n                        <p class=\"price\"> \n          